@startuml UseCase_F_ResizeObjects
title Use Case F: 縮放物件 (Resize objects)

actor User
participant __anUMLEditor__ as UMLEditor
participant __aCanvas__ as Canvas
participant __aSelectMode__ as SelectMode
participant __aBasicObject__ as BasicObject
participant __aPort__ as Port

note over UMLEditor: Precondition: Select按鈕被按下

User -> Canvas ++ : 1. 將滑鼠移動至某基本物件範圍內

Canvas -> SelectMode ++ : mouseMoved(MouseEvent)
SelectMode -> BasicObject ++ : setHovered(true)
BasicObject -->> SelectMode -- : return
SelectMode -> BasicObject ++ : 2. 將此基本物件的ports做明確顯示
BasicObject -->> SelectMode -- : return
SelectMode -> Canvas : repaint()
SelectMode -->> Canvas -- : return

User -> Canvas : 3. 使用者點選該基本物件的任一port按住左鍵不放

Canvas -> SelectMode ++ : mousePressed(MouseEvent)
SelectMode -> Canvas ++ : getShapes()迴圈
Canvas -->> SelectMode -- : return
SelectMode -> BasicObject ++ : 檢查isSelected()或isHovered()
BasicObject -->> SelectMode -- : (結果)
SelectMode -> BasicObject ++ : getPortAt(Point)
BasicObject -> Port ++ : contains(Point)
Port -->> BasicObject -- : 回傳true(點擊在Port上)
BasicObject -->> SelectMode -- : 回傳Port
SelectMode -> Canvas ++ : clearSelection()
Canvas -->> SelectMode -- : return
SelectMode -> BasicObject ++ : setSelected(true)
BasicObject -->> SelectMode -- : return
note right of SelectMode: 鎖定選取,確保縮放過程Port不消失
SelectMode -> SelectMode ++ : draggedPort = Port\ndraggedShape = BasicObject
SelectMode -->> SelectMode -- : return
SelectMode -> Canvas : repaint()
SelectMode -->> Canvas -- : return

User -> Canvas : 4. 不放開左鍵進行拖曳(drag)

Canvas -> SelectMode ++ : mouseDragged(MouseEvent)
SelectMode -> SelectMode ++ : draggedPort != null(縮放狀態)
SelectMode -->> SelectMode -- : (檢查)
SelectMode -> BasicObject ++ : resize(Port, Point)
BasicObject -> BasicObject ++ : 根據Port位置計算新的邊界\n(支援反向拖曳-Alternative F.2)
BasicObject -->> BasicObject -- : return
BasicObject -> BasicObject ++ : setBounds(x, y, width, height)\nupdatePorts()重新計算所有Port
BasicObject -->> BasicObject -- : return
BasicObject -->> SelectMode -- : return
SelectMode -> Canvas : repaint()
SelectMode -->> Canvas -- : return
Canvas -> Canvas ++ : 6. 顯示正在縮放的圖形
Canvas -->> Canvas -- : return

User -> Canvas : 5. 拖曳到座標x,y放開左鍵

Canvas -> SelectMode ++ : mouseReleased(MouseEvent)
SelectMode -> SelectMode ++ : 清除draggedPort和draggedShape
SelectMode -->> SelectMode -- : return
SelectMode -> Canvas : repaint()
SelectMode -->> Canvas -- : return

note right of BasicObject: Alternative F.1: 若點擊的是composite物件\n則無法進行縮放，放開後維持原大小
note right of BasicObject: Alternative F.2: 支援反向拖曳\n系統自動重新計算並轉換物件的基準座標
note right of BasicObject: Alternative F.3: 若新尺寸小於最小值(如20 pixels)\n系統應強制繪製為預設的最小尺寸

@enduml